# Check form 3, itemLevel, the arm that fails: 1049 (hasItemLevel 117) on TRIGGER_NPC. A char with the Memorandoll talks to
# Isakoth, whose trigger sends the event; the average item level is far under 117 and nothing completes.
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=0,0,0 job=WAR lvl=5
keyitem Memorandoll
login
record take 1049
trigger Isakoth
finish-if-event
